"verlas."
msgstr ""
"Register the captain's SNP username and password here and you'll have the "
"SNP points of all your players in Zyra, updated every week. You'll see "
"everyone's level at a glance and it will be easier to set up the pairs for "
"matches. Your credentials are stored encrypted and nobody can see them."

